{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"<@360967589511561218> *Malathor approacheth*","created_at":"2021-08-23T19:24:52.751000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879446113390854174","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"Ah Malathor! It's been too long. I'm glad to see you no longer have any spiders stalking you.\"\nHe gets up and offers a seat on the rubble next to him that he cleaned with Prestidigitation","created_at":"2021-08-23T19:26:00.712000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879446398439919748","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"*Appearing over the distinct rubble-filled horizon is Malathor, dressed in his favored crimson red robes trimmed with silver, he is carrying in both hands,* ***A box***. \"Ah, Mr. Midask, I apologize if I made you wait, the streets are a bit *difficult* to traverse...\" *Malathor takes a seat beside fin, sitting criss-cross on the ground.*","created_at":"2021-08-23T19:29:47.044000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879447347745132565","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"Oh I understand you're a very busy man.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T19:30:16.585000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879447471649079356","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"*Malathor sets the box down infront of him near the rest of the picnic.* \"*Indeed*, as are you from what I have heard, I was suprised to hear you were interested in interviewing an unremarkable old man such as myself.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T19:31:41.681000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879447828567556177","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"Oh quite the contrary, stories and word of mouth have surfaced of a great many philanthropic missions you have been creating around the city. It has left myself and many of my listeners in great curiosity\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T19:33:16.759000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879448227353604127","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"You have been known as the most unorthodox humanitarian in the city. I told myself *I've gotta meet this guy* I have Bo to thank for getting me in contact with you.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T19:34:02.471000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879448419083644988","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"*Malathor makes a gesture with his hand at the rubble around him.* \"Indeed, Bo is excellent at introducing people, I am just sad this place was destroyed so soon after I put him in charge.\" *Malathor says with a sad chuckle.* \"Though, I would hardly call myself a *Philanthropist*.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T19:37:42.981000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-23T19:38:11.991000Z","id":"879449343969615872","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"It is very unfortunate. The past two days I've been here and about with my retainers clearing the rubble and searching for survivors. Helped many, but found a lot more unfortunate people. It's fair that word of mouth isn't always the most reliable. That does bring me to the question of, what *would* you call yourself? What is your mission in life? I've heard of your feats taking in and helping survivors of the sewers, I had done that before as well.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T19:40:39.673000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879450085069582387","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"*Malathor again waves his hand dismissively.* \"Oh, well I only offer what most would consider a common courtesy to those who've gone through tragedy, You know I've been called many things,\" *Malathor leans in towards Finn.* \"I have been called a servant, and a friend, a brother, and a criminal, a fool and *a fiend...* And many more things. All labels that I have inherited, been given and lost at one point or another\" *Malathor leans away with a glimmer in his eye.* \"As for what I call myself, I am simply Malathor... So what is it you have brought for us to today Finn?\" *Malathor says gesturing to the picnic.*","created_at":"2021-08-23T19:47:46.933000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879451877127913533","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"Well, I want to get the scoop on who you choose to be. One question that has left many listeners wondering has been what is going on with the seeds you have been seen planting around the city. They appear to be just normal apple trees, but I believe someone like you has a plan and a mission for this relentless botany.\"\nFinn says and heads to share in the picnic","created_at":"2021-08-23T19:53:47.871000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879453391011610625","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"*Malathor reaches into the basket and grabs a nondescript slice of bread, spreading a nondescript jar of jam over it, before adding a nondescript drizzle of honey onto it.* \"Ah yes, *My botony project...*\" *Malathor takes a bite of his half sandwich before leaning back and resting with one palm laid flat behind him.* \"Nothing more than a personal project, think of it as, half-*beautification*, half-future source of income and nourishment... A way to bring a little slice of my homeland, *to this land...* speaking of, allow me to make my contribution to this lovely meal.\" *And Malathor reaches down, lifting the lid from* ***The Box.***","created_at":"2021-08-23T19:59:27.033000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879454813560127498","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/jpeg","filename":"16297487255308196348122976930920.jpg","id":"879454993520939019","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/851195363888201749/879454993520939019-16297487255308196348122976930920.jpg","message_id":"879454993818714133","sha256":"190838308386e2b548b95a2cd4885f4af1b49f2914078f31c73fe758a0840158","size":1934626,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/851195363888201749/879454993520939019/16297487255308196348122976930920.jpg?ex=6ac0b609&is=6abf6489&hm=131955e9d2d6b84acc5c74bea8c69e8d24f60fba6acbb94b15bb814bb916d5e4&"}],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"","created_at":"2021-08-23T20:00:10.010000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879454993818714133","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"Transylvanian Chimney cakes. One of my nephews *Favorites.*\" *Malathor says with a grin, finishing the rest of his half-sandwich, jam now dripping down his chin.*","created_at":"2021-08-23T20:01:29.227000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879455326078922753","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"Finn takes one of the delicious chimney cakes and eats it","created_at":"2021-08-23T20:01:41.806000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879455378839056486","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"He dabs his mouth and replies\n\"A personal project of beautification? And this income you speak of, do you plan on cutting down, replanting and selling its produce afterwards? Additionally, where is your homeland?\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T20:03:03.394000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879455721043922995","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"*Malathor watches intently as Finn consume one of the Chimneys. It's very good, freshly baked as well. Finn gains 5 temporary hitpoints that will last for the next 12 hours.*","created_at":"2021-08-23T20:06:10.308000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879456505018069002","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"During this time whenever Finn speaks, he will give hope and feelings of ***inspiration*** to Malathor. *Malathor will gain 11 temporary hitpoints that will last until the end of his next long rest*","created_at":"2021-08-23T20:08:00.004000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879456965116432404","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"Oh, I don't plan on doing much with them myself, after all what I have planted here will likely be around *long after* I have passed. I take solace that there will be others to, *enjoy* the fruits of my labor.\" *Malathor says with a look of contentment.* \"I have mentioned it before, but I shall do so again for the purposes of your audience, *yesss,* I will tell you of my homeland... Transylvania, a historical region rich in magic and mystery, located in central Romania. Bound on the east and south by its natural borders, the Carpathian mountain range, extending westward to the Apuseni Mountains...\" *Malathor says in a reminiscent tone.*","created_at":"2021-08-23T20:10:38.050000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879457628009402419","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
